Hi Heidi,
assuming your GPS returns standard lat/long coordinates using the WGS84 ellipsoid (normally the default) it is
shapefileProjection <- "+proj=longlat +ellps=WGS84 +datum=WGS84 +no_defs"
See here: http://spatialreference.org/ref/epsg/4326/   (go to "Proj4")
Regards,
Jürgen

